  <item>
    <title>0006 家庭保险的长期主义 with 嗯嗯洪</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6637572f4b7d3b5d3b20b9c4</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6637572f4b7d3b5d3b20b9c4</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 May 2024 09:53:49 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>首先，祝大家假期快乐~</span></p><span></span><p><span>这个假期，我和嗯嗯洪定了目标：为家庭配置一套保险，由此我们开始认真研究和请教。昨晚，我们又再聊起，嗯嗯洪说了很多自己的想法，我觉得很真实、很珍贵。特别地，嗯嗯洪强调配置重疾险、寿险应该秉持长期主义心态。哇，太深刻了！看来嗯嗯洪当保险经纪人是有一定天赋在的。</span></p><span></span><p><em><span>特别声明：本期内容仅为我们的个人观点。</span></em></p><span></span><p><span>【节目大纲】</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场白</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="32">00:32</a> 嗯嗯洪出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">01:21</a> 应该让寿险保到几岁？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 思考新的社会结构对我们决策的影响</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="296">04:56</a> 供养时间拉长，作为家庭支柱的时长也会拉长</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="434">07:14</a> 嗯嗯洪为什么对寿险这么执着？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="620">10:20</a> 预算吃紧的情况下，我们的策略是……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="634">10:34</a> 嗯嗯洪“伟大而无私”的理想</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="709">11:49</a> 我们投保重疾险的顾虑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="948">15:48</a> 嗯嗯洪自（妥）洽（协）了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="976">16:16</a> 对保司的担忧是无可避免的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 我们希望选择一家长期主义的保险公司</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1114">18:34</a> 长期主义！投保需要很强的信念</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1240">20:40</a> 嗯嗯洪 say googbye</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1275">21:15</a> 对我们以为的国家保险“兜底”政策的声明</span></p><span></span><p><span>【联系】</span></p><span></span><p><span>陈在夏的主页：<a data-url="http://jike.city/zaixia" href="http://jike.city/zaixia">jike.city</a></span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lnknRp2xfdKMmch59gZaJmduXMbW.m4a" length="22020727" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:30</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhIlUz6uL-fI_ZEEIVzHq_mUxhbO.png"/>
