  <item>
    <title>0003 南雄漫游with万思</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/651ea24fa3b0404cbfa760a1</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">651ea24fa3b0404cbfa760a1</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 05 Oct 2023 11:47:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>Hello，朋友！你肯定度过了一个美妙的假期~</span></p><span></span><p><span>对我和万思来说，这个长假也是一次美好的回忆。万思第一次跟我“回老家”，感受南雄的风貌和风情。万思说，南雄是一个值得的地方。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎞️ shownote</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="27">00:27</a> 万思出场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="49">00:49</a> 万思对南雄总体的印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">01:02</a> “小台北”怎么来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 中秋节：堵车、</span><strong><span>酸笋鸭</span></strong><span>、吃辣、新式月饼、中秋习俗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="757">12:37</a> 9月30日：炒螺肉、南雄辣椒、维新路饭馆、步行街、洋汾水</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1270">21:10</a> 国庆日：北门早餐店、楼盘、珠玑古巷、芋头片、芋荷、炒石螺、</span><strong><span>炒河蚬</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2016">33:36</a> 10月2日：老家、</span><strong><span>水库</span></strong><span>、吃席</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2566">42:46</a> 10月3日：吃席</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2592">43:12</a> 总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2672">44:32</a> 秀一秀</span><strong><span>南雄话</span></strong><span>（垮了……）</span></p><span></span><p><span>📷 photos</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl81f1Yi3IvE9XQjkhhx4ydhMmY-.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvLh-cr3GB3-Vxj8HrC8_3dzHF2X.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhiRLUsYrhhXtT5PU9cFeeDMzP9k.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
